OL,3,AAssad officer extradited to Syria on
OL,4,Awar crimes charges for first time
OL,5,
OL,6,FLebanon has handed Syria a former
OL,7,Fgeneral who served under the ousted
OL,8,Fregime of Bashar al-Assad, in the first
OL,9,Fextradition of its kind since his
OL,10,Fgovernment fell.
OL,12,FMaj Gen Adel Issa, 67, is accused of a
OL,13,Fraft of crimes allegedly committed
OL,14,Fduring the Syrian civil war, which
OL,15,Fended in December 2024 when rebel
OL,16,Fforces took the capital, Damascus, and
OL,17,FAssad fled.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
