OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AAssad officer extradited to Syria on
OL,4,Awar crimes charges for first time
OL,5,
OL,6,FIssa was detained on 8 August after
OL,7,Fvisiting the Syrian embassy in Beirut
OL,8,Fto complete paperwork and was
OL,9,Ftransferred into Syrian custody on
OL,10,FWednesday.
OL,12,FThe handover follows pressure from
OL,13,FSyria's new authorities on Lebanon to
OL,14,Fact against former security and
OL,15,Fmilitary officials who fled across the
OL,16,Fborder after Assad's fall.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
